---
import { site, mailto, asset } from "../data/site";
---
<section class="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
  <h2 id="about-h" class="sr-only">How I work</h2>
  <dl class="facts" data-reveal>
    <div><dt>Place</dt><dd>{site.location}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Building apps since</dt><dd>{site.since}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Reach me</dt><dd><a href={mailto}>By email</a></dd></div>
  </dl>
  <div class="about-text" data-reveal style="--d:100ms">
    <p><strong>Ye Yint Ko Ko.</strong> I care most about the part of an app users never see: the structure that lets a team keep changing it.</p>
    <p class="about-body">At Binary Lab and JOYGroups I have worked with iOS, backend, QA, product and design to coordinate API contracts, and I mentor junior Android developers through code review. I would rather leave a codebase easier to change than clever.</p>
    <p class="about-body soft">I work remotely from {site.location} ({site.utcLabel}) and I am open to remote-first teams that hire internationally.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="about-pic" data-reveal style="--d:160ms">
    <img src={asset("img/about.jpg")} alt="Concrete building against a pale sky" width="900" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  </div>
</section>
